Our fine-tuning methods do not require personal data, and any optional fine-tuning on client material will be conducted in accordance with defined data use terms and GDPR compliance. We will ensure that our solution is integrated into the existing hospital information system and electronic patient record, supporting health interoperability standards and national frameworks.

Overall, our proposed AI strategy leverages our strengths in RAG capabilities, explainability tools, and past experience to provide a robust and transparent solution that meets the client's requirements for intelligent assistance, while prioritizing data sovereignty, security, and compliance with regulatory constraints.
